---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const links = [
  { label: "X / Twitter", href: "https://x.com/mu7suki_" },
  { label: "GitHub", href: "https://github.com/mu7suki" },
];
---
<Base title="about me" current="aboutme">
  <article class="post">
    <h1 class="post-title">mu7suki</h1>
    <div class="post-body">
      <p>最近は3DCGとイラストをメインに楽しんでます。グラフィックデザインと作曲も少しだけ。</p>
    </div>

    <ul class="sns">
      {links.map((l) => <li><a href={l.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{l.label}</a></li>)}
    </ul>
  </article>
</Base>
